        "original_id": "8ad66bcb-b52c-5f71-96d0-a660d8180d36",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: United States Auto Club, WC Vision, SCCA\n- Events: 1991 USAC FF2000 Championship, United States National Championship, Indianapolis 500, Pirelli World Challenge\n- Teams: K-PAX Racing\n- Places: California, Arizona\n\nFacts:\n- From 1956 to 1979, the United States Auto Club sanctioned the United States National Championship.\n- From 1956 to 1997, the United States Auto Club sanctioned the Indianapolis 500.\n- The 1991 USAC FF2000 Championship was sanctioned by the United States Auto Club.\n- The 1991 USAC FF2000 Championship ran races in California and Arizona.\n- Since 2008, WC Vision has managed the Pirelli World Challenge.\n- Since 2017, the United States Auto Club has sanctioned the Pirelli World Challenge.\n- K-PAX Racing is an automobile racing team in the SCCA's Pirelli World Challenge racing series.",
